<p>Please check your personalization details and shipping address before placing your order. To request a change or cancellation, contact us within 2 days of ordering. Incorrect addresses may cause delivery delays, so let us know about any error as soon as possible.</p>

<p>After the 2-day change window, production takes about 2 days. USPS delivery then typically takes 5–7 days, though postal delays, weather, and other factors may affect arrival.</p>

<p>Once your order ships, we'll email your tracking number. You can <a href="https://tools.usps.com/tracking/?tLabels" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">track it with USPS</a>, or <a href="#contact-follow-us">contact us</a> and we'll check the status for you.</p>

<p>We'll do our best to prepare and ship your order as quickly as possible, with care at every step.</p>
